    "['clock bits-type [parameter1] [parameter2]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'network-clock input-source 1 external 2m', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'network-clock input-source 1 external 2m', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nnetwork-clock input-source 1 external 2m\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- In Cisco, `network-clock input-source` is used to specify an external clock source, analogous to Huawei's `clock bits-type`.\\n- `1` represents the clock source index (similar to `bits0` in Huawei).\\n- `external` indicates it's an external clock source (like Huawei's BITS interface).\\n- `2m` specifies the 2Mbps line type (equivalent to Huawei's `2mbps`).\", 'trans_template': 'network-clock input-source 1 external 2m'}]]": 1,
